1
00:00:22,354 --> 00:00:24,306
[Late one night]

2
00:00:24,665 --> 00:00:27,039
[An abandoned warehouse]

3
00:00:27,592 --> 00:00:28,698
(DOHOON) Guys!

4
00:00:28,699 --> 00:00:29,675
[KYUNGMIN) Guys!

5
00:00:29,676 --> 00:00:32,164
(HANJIN) Guys! Can you hear me?

6
00:00:35,906 --> 00:00:37,467
Oh no...

7
00:00:37,468 --> 00:00:38,557
Oh no

8
00:00:38,558 --> 00:00:39,843
Ah...

9
00:00:40,233 --> 00:00:42,852
I don't think I can do this

10
00:00:42,853 --> 00:00:44,252
Seriously, right now

11
00:00:44,253 --> 00:00:47,034
it feels like there's someone behind me

12
00:00:49,930 --> 00:00:51,573
I guess everyone's starting separately

13
00:00:51,574 --> 00:00:53,460
I'm the worst at doing things on my own

14
00:00:57,251 --> 00:01:00,293
I don't want to scream

15
00:01:00,294 --> 00:01:02,050
Oh no

16
00:01:02,392 --> 00:01:03,823
I hope I'll do well

17
00:01:03,824 --> 00:01:06,020
My goal is to survive until the end

18
00:01:06,021 --> 00:01:07,646
and that's it

19
00:01:08,883 --> 00:01:11,470
This is crazy

20
00:01:11,471 --> 00:01:12,511
Get it together

21
00:01:12,512 --> 00:01:14,366
I just need to get it together

22
00:01:16,155 --> 00:01:19,197
I'll survive no matter what

23
00:01:20,662 --> 00:01:25,184
[A suspicious being is searching for TWS]

24
00:01:32,034 --> 00:01:35,434
[Get caught]

25
00:01:37,207 --> 00:01:39,159
(YOUNGJAE) I'll hang in there for dear life

26
00:01:40,201 --> 00:01:43,406
[or survive till the end]

27
00:01:45,016 --> 00:01:46,350
He's here

28
00:01:51,345 --> 00:01:53,606
[Never-ending game in the dark]

29
00:02:06,345 --> 00:02:08,248
It's over for me

30
00:02:08,249 --> 00:02:09,924
I'm so scared

31
00:02:12,267 --> 00:02:14,381
(JIHOON) Hold up

32
00:02:14,382 --> 00:02:16,204
(JIHOON) Something's wrong

33
00:02:17,896 --> 00:02:19,588
(JIHOON) This isn't right!

34
00:02:19,897 --> 00:02:21,687
It's so real...

35
00:02:21,688 --> 00:02:23,102
We're in trouble

36
00:02:28,227 --> 00:02:29,967
Wow...

37
00:02:29,968 --> 00:02:32,017
Seriously, what is this?

38
00:02:34,441 --> 00:02:40,428
Oh my god

39
00:02:44,626 --> 00:02:46,089
Hold up

40
00:02:46,090 --> 00:02:48,335
Seriously, KYUNGMIN

41
00:02:49,344 --> 00:02:50,775
Guys...

42
00:02:52,386 --> 00:02:53,980
(KYUNGMIN) Guys!

43
00:02:55,754 --> 00:02:58,194
I'm really bad at stuff like this

44
00:03:06,215 --> 00:03:08,427
I can't see in front of me

45
00:03:14,626 --> 00:03:15,813
Wow

46
00:03:15,814 --> 00:03:17,066
Can they do this?

47
00:03:29,870 --> 00:03:32,424
Why did they put me here?

48
00:03:43,146 --> 00:03:45,358
Seriously, what is this?

49
00:03:51,442 --> 00:03:53,883
What am I supposed to do?

50
00:03:56,941 --> 00:03:59,610
[DOHOON shrieking]

51
00:04:00,211 --> 00:04:03,465
[Some kind of head]

52
00:04:03,466 --> 00:04:05,434
This is crazy

53
00:04:05,435 --> 00:04:06,963
What is this?

54
00:04:08,590 --> 00:04:10,542
It's so scary... What is this?

55
00:04:12,088 --> 00:04:13,894
I don't think I can do this

56
00:04:15,749 --> 00:04:16,968
Wait

57
00:04:16,969 --> 00:04:19,458
so are we supposed to hide? No?

58
00:04:20,873 --> 00:04:23,411
I'm really scared

59
00:04:23,412 --> 00:04:25,184
Wait, I'm not scared

60
00:04:25,916 --> 00:04:28,747
This is just a factory, nothing to it

61
00:04:28,748 --> 00:04:30,911
That's right

62
00:04:33,953 --> 00:04:37,028
But this spot is a bit scary

63
00:04:38,639 --> 00:04:41,356
[HANJIN] [YOUNGJAE] [KYUNGMIN]

64
00:04:41,357 --> 00:04:44,024
[JIHOON] [SHINYU] [DOHOON]

65
00:04:44,870 --> 00:04:46,497
[Phone notification]

66
00:04:46,823 --> 00:04:48,335
(JIHOON) Whoa, why's this so loud?

67
00:04:48,336 --> 00:04:49,067
(KYUNGMIN) Something just arrived

68
00:04:49,068 --> 00:04:49,913
(HANJIN) I just got a text

69
00:04:49,914 --> 00:04:51,621
(DOHOON) Oh no...

70
00:04:52,337 --> 00:04:54,040
From now on, find hidden keys

71
00:04:54,041 --> 00:04:56,974
in anything that can move

72
00:04:56,975 --> 00:05:00,300
If the seeker catches you
you can use a key to get free or

73
00:05:00,293 --> 00:05:02,245
you can free another member

74
00:05:02,246 --> 00:05:04,539
You can escape once with one key

75
00:05:04,540 --> 00:05:06,150
Do I have to search
for a key here?

76
00:05:06,719 --> 00:05:08,069
I don't see anything

77
00:05:08,070 --> 00:05:09,761
What does a key look like?

78
00:05:12,901 --> 00:05:15,407
What's 'something that moves'?

79
00:05:16,448 --> 00:05:18,856
Let's give this a shot... Let's go

80
00:05:24,534 --> 00:05:26,567
I don't see anything

81
00:05:30,602 --> 00:05:32,473
We're starting, right?

82
00:05:35,109 --> 00:05:38,476
Look for the keys
in something that moves

83
00:05:42,495 --> 00:05:43,471
Feels like...

84
00:05:44,382 --> 00:05:46,529
The keys would be hidden here

85
00:05:47,928 --> 00:05:52,630
[TWS each go searching for the keys]

86
00:05:54,761 --> 00:05:57,527
[Special effects sound]

87
00:05:57,999 --> 00:05:59,203
What is that?

88
00:05:59,204 --> 00:06:00,244
It made me jump...

89
00:06:00,976 --> 00:06:02,880
Nah, I'm not scared

90
00:06:02,881 --> 00:06:06,540
I'm not scared or anything
I'm just a little worried

91
00:06:06,541 --> 00:06:08,167
Well...

92
00:06:08,168 --> 00:06:09,940
The keys

93
00:06:15,667 --> 00:06:18,075
[Hears something nearby]

94
00:06:19,246 --> 00:06:20,775
It was probably the director

95
00:06:20,776 --> 00:06:21,963
I'm sorry

96
00:06:22,191 --> 00:06:25,363
I said I wasn't scared

97
00:06:26,258 --> 00:06:27,804
I don't think there're any keys here

98
00:06:29,512 --> 00:06:31,497
♪ Keys, keys ♪

99
00:06:31,498 --> 00:06:33,810
♪ Where are you ♪

100
00:06:33,811 --> 00:06:35,483
[HANJIN]

101
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:37,207
Guys!

102
00:06:38,639 --> 00:06:40,315
(HANJIN) Can you hear me?

103
00:06:40,998 --> 00:06:42,608
(HANJIN) Guys?

104
00:06:43,178 --> 00:06:44,610
(HANJIN) KYUNGMIN!

105
00:06:46,302 --> 00:06:49,409
[DOHOON→]
Guys!

106
00:06:49,848 --> 00:06:50,971
Guys!

107
00:06:51,719 --> 00:06:52,809
(KYUNGMIN) DOHOON!

108
00:06:52,810 --> 00:06:53,736
Hey!

109
00:06:54,078 --> 00:06:58,162
[KYUNGMIN] [DOHOON]
[Meets KYUNGMIN as soon as he steps outside]

110
00:06:58,276 --> 00:07:00,000
Did you come out from over there?

111
00:07:00,001 --> 00:07:00,732
(KYUNGMIN) Yeah!

112
00:07:01,285 --> 00:07:03,091
(DOHOON) Hey, but
can we even find these keys?

113
00:07:03,092 --> 00:07:03,774
We have to

114
00:07:03,775 --> 00:07:05,759
I'm so scared of the seeker

115
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:07,971
But right now
the seeker is definitely not out there

116
00:07:07,972 --> 00:07:09,761
I can hear footsteps

117
00:07:15,439 --> 00:07:16,838
The seeker isn't here now

118
00:07:16,839 --> 00:07:18,400
and the keys are definitely in these boxes

119
00:07:25,054 --> 00:07:27,625
I don't see any keys at all

120
00:07:27,626 --> 00:07:30,879
[DOHOON] [KYUNGMIN]
[They separate to look for the keys]

121
00:07:32,375 --> 00:07:33,856
Should I climb up here?

122
00:07:46,545 --> 00:07:47,636
What's this?

123
00:07:48,628 --> 00:07:50,011
(DOHOON) This is totally crazy

124
00:07:51,443 --> 00:07:53,069
(DOHOON) Wow, it's so scary up here

125
00:07:55,022 --> 00:07:57,153
It's so scary I can't do this

126
00:07:58,633 --> 00:07:59,756
But

127
00:08:02,017 --> 00:08:04,149
I'll try and do this thing
and not be scared this time

128
00:08:05,418 --> 00:08:06,979
[HANJIN's voice calls from afar]

129
00:08:06,980 --> 00:08:09,826
[← HANJIN] [DOHOON →]

130
00:08:10,070 --> 00:08:11,730
[DOHOON didn't hear him]

131
00:08:12,641 --> 00:08:13,991
There aren't any keys

132
00:08:19,507 --> 00:08:21,199
I think

133
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:22,793
I shouldn't be here

134
00:08:23,948 --> 00:08:26,291
Usually I totally can't go to places
like this on my own

135
00:08:26,292 --> 00:08:29,138
[DOHOON]
I think I'm pretty awesome

136
00:08:30,195 --> 00:08:32,180
[JIHOON]

137
00:08:32,181 --> 00:08:35,287
I have no idea
what this place is

138
00:08:40,705 --> 00:08:44,837
How are we supposed to find the keys?

139
00:08:48,124 --> 00:08:50,531
The seeker's probably not out yet

140
00:08:56,828 --> 00:08:59,642
[JIHOON spots something]

141
00:08:59,643 --> 00:09:01,188
It says to push

142
00:09:02,131 --> 00:09:04,279
(JIHOON) It says 'Please push'

143
00:09:06,166 --> 00:09:08,444
I don't think I should push this

144
00:09:09,078 --> 00:09:10,624
Should I try?

145
00:09:12,722 --> 00:09:14,024
Let me go push it

146
00:09:25,591 --> 00:09:26,421
What's that?

147
00:09:27,689 --> 00:09:29,707
[A horrifying scream rings out]

148
00:09:30,342 --> 00:09:31,741
[And someone comes towards JIHOON]

149
00:09:32,554 --> 00:09:33,726
Who's that?

150
00:09:33,727 --> 00:09:34,767
(JIHOON) I pressed something

151
00:09:34,768 --> 00:09:36,576
(YOUNGJAE) Haven't we started yet?
We've started, right?

152
00:09:36,557 --> 00:09:37,598
I don't know

153
00:09:38,118 --> 00:09:39,566
Why did it say 'push'?

154
00:09:40,103 --> 00:09:41,762
We've started, right?

155
00:09:44,073 --> 00:09:46,741
[He tries pushing it again]

156
00:09:50,889 --> 00:09:52,061
I fell for it!

157
00:09:52,402 --> 00:09:55,461
[It has nothing to do with the seeker]

158
00:09:55,721 --> 00:09:56,876
[YOUNGJAE] [JIHOON]

159
00:09:56,877 --> 00:09:58,731
How come you're moving around so well?

160
00:09:59,008 --> 00:10:00,033
I don't think the seeker's here yet

161
00:10:00,066 --> 00:10:04,508
[YOUNGJAE] [JIHOON]

162
00:10:04,509 --> 00:10:05,809
[YOUNGJAE]

163
00:10:05,810 --> 00:10:09,486
[SHINYU] [YOUNGJAE]
[SHINYU still hasn't left the starting point]

164
00:10:11,389 --> 00:10:13,456
Seriously

165
00:10:17,799 --> 00:10:18,987
I need to get a hold of myself

166
00:10:18,988 --> 00:10:21,346
I just need to get a hold of myself

167
00:10:21,347 --> 00:10:23,412
There's nothing to be scared of

168
00:10:25,607 --> 00:10:27,773
[Footsteps coming closer]

169
00:10:30,098 --> 00:10:31,807
It's one of the members!

170
00:10:34,329 --> 00:10:36,688
[Footsteps belong to YOUNGJAE]

171
00:10:37,161 --> 00:10:39,909
[← SHINYU] [YOUNGJAE →]

172
00:10:40,219 --> 00:10:41,422
Woah!

173
00:10:44,546 --> 00:10:45,603
Oh...

174
00:10:46,205 --> 00:10:48,385
Woah...

175
00:10:50,012 --> 00:10:52,322
[Going around and finally finding each other]

176
00:11:07,143 --> 00:11:10,202
[YOUNGJAE leaves SHINYU and hides first]

177
00:11:11,780 --> 00:11:13,748
Do I have to hide too?

178
00:11:20,288 --> 00:11:22,045
(YOUNGJAE) This looks like a good spot

179
00:11:22,826 --> 00:11:24,958
[YOUNGJAE finds a safe place to hide]

180
00:11:25,983 --> 00:11:28,911
[SHINYU]

181
00:11:28,912 --> 00:11:31,921
[SHINYU goes deeper looking for a hiding spot]

182
00:11:31,922 --> 00:11:34,817
Should I hide?

183
00:11:38,103 --> 00:11:40,267
I'm going to hide here

184
00:11:42,301 --> 00:11:44,704
(SHINYU) I'm not going to fit

185
00:11:44,644 --> 00:11:46,400
Oh no!

186
00:11:51,834 --> 00:11:53,575
This looks good

187
00:11:54,144 --> 00:11:55,836
(SHINYU) I can fit in here

188
00:11:55,837 --> 00:11:58,373
(SHINYU) This spot is amazing

189
00:11:58,374 --> 00:12:02,295
I'm going to listen for anything out there

190
00:12:02,296 --> 00:12:04,573
and then I'll move

191
00:12:04,702 --> 00:12:08,282
[SHINYU's hidden behind a wall]
(SHINYU) Right now...

192
00:12:08,283 --> 00:12:10,820
(SHINYU) I'm aiming to hide till the end

193
00:12:10,821 --> 00:12:13,049
(SHINYU) I won't be captured

194
00:12:13,178 --> 00:12:14,317
[Phone alert]

195
00:12:15,668 --> 00:12:17,490
It's a hint for the keys!

196
00:12:17,571 --> 00:12:19,524
[Hint for the keys]

197
00:12:20,158 --> 00:12:22,485
[SHINYU checks the hint too]

198
00:12:23,721 --> 00:12:24,744
I won't need keys

199
00:12:24,714 --> 00:12:27,642
in the first place
if I don't get caught and stay hidden

200
00:12:29,203 --> 00:12:31,938
Yeah, this is the way to go

201
00:12:31,939 --> 00:12:34,296
Let's wait it out

202
00:12:39,079 --> 00:12:41,341
[SHINYU's sigh]

203
00:12:41,926 --> 00:12:43,814
(SHINYU) This is really scary

204
00:12:43,815 --> 00:12:46,221
(SHINYU) I need to put my phone
on silent mode

205
00:12:46,498 --> 00:12:48,768
(SHINYU) How do I silence it?

206
00:12:48,711 --> 00:12:49,703
(SHINYU) Vibrate

207
00:12:49,704 --> 00:12:52,013
(SHINYU) Okay
I've put it in vibrate mode

208
00:12:52,014 --> 00:12:53,965
I'm so clever

209
00:12:53,966 --> 00:12:55,609
like this...

210
00:12:56,145 --> 00:12:58,553
I have to be clever like this

211
00:13:01,189 --> 00:13:02,539
[Phone vibrates]

212
00:13:02,540 --> 00:13:04,443
(YOUNGJAE) (Phone alert) I'm going to
put this on silent mode

213
00:13:06,590 --> 00:13:08,998
Shouldn't I just stay over here like this?

214
00:13:08,999 --> 00:13:10,722
Then we just win

215
00:13:11,113 --> 00:13:13,456
[HANJIN]
Stay positive

216
00:13:13,815 --> 00:13:16,156
Think positive thoughts, HANJIN

217
00:13:17,572 --> 00:13:19,394
If I get caught... well...

218
00:13:19,395 --> 00:13:21,086
I'll just...

219
00:13:21,313 --> 00:13:22,436
Oh!

220
00:13:22,437 --> 00:13:24,665
[← Golf clubs]
What if I keep this with me?

221
00:13:24,860 --> 00:13:27,610
I'll just take this along just in case

222
00:13:31,497 --> 00:13:32,812
The keys...

223
00:13:32,784 --> 00:13:33,841
Should I open this?

224
00:13:34,638 --> 00:13:37,469
[HANJIN opens the fridge]

225
00:13:40,869 --> 00:13:42,041
Ah!

226
00:13:42,058 --> 00:13:42,984
Isn't this that thing?

227
00:13:44,497 --> 00:13:46,921
[Finds a thrown-out cactus doll]

228
00:13:47,328 --> 00:13:49,052
Ah! Ah!

229
00:13:50,239 --> 00:13:51,574
This is cute!

230
00:13:52,176 --> 00:13:54,405
[The cactus starts singing]

231
00:13:57,675 --> 00:14:00,424
I'll use this to distract the seeker

232
00:14:07,257 --> 00:14:09,014
Is it too noisy?

233
00:14:12,073 --> 00:14:13,830
Why did it turn off automatically?

234
00:14:17,132 --> 00:14:18,548
Oh my gosh!

235
00:14:18,549 --> 00:14:20,988
Why do you look so cute?

236
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:24,421
[Ran into a street sweeper]

237
00:14:28,098 --> 00:14:29,871
I found it!

238
00:14:30,359 --> 00:14:32,490
[HANJIN finds the first key in the sweeper]

239
00:14:32,882 --> 00:14:33,694
HANJIN, did you find the car keys?

240
00:14:33,695 --> 00:14:34,931
You made me jump!

241
00:14:34,932 --> 00:14:37,436
(HANJIN) I thought you were the seeker

242
00:14:37,437 --> 00:14:38,705
[Phone alert]

243
00:14:38,917 --> 00:14:41,194
[The next hint arrives]

244
00:14:41,504 --> 00:14:44,367
[Hint to the keys]
Where is this?

245
00:14:45,147 --> 00:14:47,165
Where's this place?

246
00:14:47,393 --> 00:14:49,215
[HANJIN] [KYUNGMIN]
Where are the others?

247
00:14:49,216 --> 00:14:50,777
I don't know

248
00:14:52,843 --> 00:14:54,063
I found it

249
00:14:54,227 --> 00:14:56,341
[JIHOON finds the second key in the manual forklift]

250
00:14:56,602 --> 00:14:58,212
I found a key

251
00:14:58,748 --> 00:14:59,920
I found it

252
00:14:59,921 --> 00:15:01,612
'Moving things'

253
00:15:01,613 --> 00:15:03,808
wasn't what I had in mind

254
00:15:03,809 --> 00:15:06,135
It was stuff like forklifts

255
00:15:06,801 --> 00:15:09,421
I will never get caught

256
00:15:09,422 --> 00:15:10,853
so I'll use this for the other members

257
00:15:12,252 --> 00:15:14,367
I just need to find a good place to hide

258
00:15:15,603 --> 00:15:17,962
I need to figure out where I am

259
00:15:32,262 --> 00:15:35,793
I've got it. I'm going to set up
my hiding place

260
00:15:35,794 --> 00:15:38,412
It's going to look like there's nothing there

261
00:15:39,144 --> 00:15:41,080
[Just then, someone goes toward JIHOON]

262
00:15:42,316 --> 00:15:46,335
If I keep calm, I'll be fine

263
00:15:46,336 --> 00:15:48,255
[Feels someone's presence]

264
00:15:49,247 --> 00:15:50,695
Wow!

265
00:15:51,004 --> 00:15:52,273
DOHOON, did you find anything?

266
00:15:52,274 --> 00:15:53,298
Did you see the hint?

267
00:15:53,299 --> 00:15:54,242
Yeah, did you find anything?

268
00:15:54,243 --> 00:15:55,641
-I didn't find anything
-I found one

269
00:15:55,642 --> 00:15:56,991
-What?
-A key!

270
00:15:57,170 --> 00:15:58,748
I think since I found a key

271
00:15:58,749 --> 00:16:00,083
the game's going to start

272
00:16:00,636 --> 00:16:02,620
I have to find a hiding place

273
00:16:05,370 --> 00:16:07,583
(DOHOON) This place is seriously scary

274
00:16:07,584 --> 00:16:08,754
(DOHOON) Can I go there?

275
00:16:09,909 --> 00:16:12,870
[DOHOON enters the machinery room]

276
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:17,393
I'm so scared!

277
00:16:21,395 --> 00:16:23,949
Where am I supposed to go?

278
00:16:26,389 --> 00:16:28,862
(YOUNGJAE) I can hear DOHOON's voice

279
00:16:29,253 --> 00:16:31,026
(YOUNGJAE) It's DOHOON. DOHOON!

280
00:16:31,027 --> 00:16:32,865
(YOUNGJAE) Feels like DOHOON

281
00:16:32,866 --> 00:16:36,248
[YOUNGJAE →]
(YOUNGJAE) Nobody's going to find me here

282
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:38,623
[DOHOON enters the generator room in the machine room]

283
00:16:39,990 --> 00:16:41,227
[DOHOON gets a fright]

284
00:16:44,139 --> 00:16:45,164
(?) DOHOON

285
00:16:45,571 --> 00:16:46,433
What?

286
00:16:49,475 --> 00:16:50,956
-(DOHOON) Who is that?
-(SHINYU) It's me Junghwan

287
00:16:50,957 --> 00:16:52,322
You gave me a fright! Why're you hiding?

288
00:16:53,430 --> 00:16:54,681
Do we have to keep moving?

289
00:16:54,682 --> 00:16:55,820
I don't know what we're supposed to do

290
00:16:55,821 --> 00:16:57,105
(DOHOON) We need to keep moving!

291
00:16:57,106 --> 00:16:58,456
We do?

292
00:16:58,457 --> 00:17:00,261
(DOHOON) We need to move around
and find the keys

293
00:17:00,945 --> 00:17:03,206
(DOHOON) You shouldn't hide!
We need to find the keys

294
00:17:03,207 --> 00:17:05,077
I don't think the seeker's here yet

295
00:17:05,078 --> 00:17:06,232
Do they alert us when the seeker's out?

296
00:17:06,233 --> 00:17:07,241
I think so!

297
00:17:07,794 --> 00:17:09,028
(SHINYU) You're great at moving around

298
00:17:09,032 --> 00:17:10,511
The seeker's not around

299
00:17:12,577 --> 00:17:14,887
-(DOHOON) It's not here
-(SHINYU) Hey, DOHOON

300
00:17:15,668 --> 00:17:22,436
[SHINYU just got a big fright from something]

301
00:17:22,550 --> 00:17:25,609
I just heard a mace...
It sounded like a mace

302
00:17:29,074 --> 00:17:31,384
[SHINYU manages to come out thanks to DOHOON]

303
00:17:32,490 --> 00:17:35,956
[DOHOON] [After leaving SHINYU, he goes to another room]

304
00:17:37,354 --> 00:17:38,803
Is this a suitcase?

305
00:17:41,439 --> 00:17:43,098
I'm going to open this

306
00:17:43,099 --> 00:17:43,944
What!

307
00:17:43,945 --> 00:17:44,936
What's this?

308
00:17:44,937 --> 00:17:46,075
(HANJIN) Why?

309
00:17:46,076 --> 00:17:47,507
Did you find it?

310
00:17:49,620 --> 00:17:52,631
[DOHOON finds the third key in the suitcase]

311
00:17:53,217 --> 00:17:54,502
Oh!

312
00:17:55,739 --> 00:17:56,438
(DOHOON) I found it!

313
00:17:56,439 --> 00:17:57,642
(DOHOON) This is amazing

314
00:17:57,643 --> 00:17:58,700
[Phone alert]

315
00:17:58,701 --> 00:18:00,099
[Got a text]

316
00:18:00,100 --> 00:18:03,288
[Hint for the keys]

317
00:18:03,289 --> 00:18:06,753
[KYUNGMIN] [Sees the hint and starts moving]

318
00:18:07,810 --> 00:18:09,681
I think it's the third one

319
00:18:10,251 --> 00:18:13,228
This spot is important for the third one

320
00:18:14,513 --> 00:18:18,043
[← KYUNGMIN] [← HANJIN]
[HANJIN is right behind KYUNGMIN]

321
00:18:20,891 --> 00:18:22,143
[↑ HANJIN] [↑ KYUNGMIN]

322
00:18:22,144 --> 00:18:23,803
Red...

323
00:18:24,014 --> 00:18:27,805
[Hint for a key] [HANJIN finds the frame in the hint]

324
00:18:31,839 --> 00:18:35,891
[But he can't find any keys]

325
00:18:36,216 --> 00:18:38,510
-Did you find the key?
-No

326
00:18:38,511 --> 00:18:40,137
But this is the place

327
00:18:40,706 --> 00:18:44,041
[This place is full of fog]

328
00:18:44,855 --> 00:18:45,782
[At that moment]

329
00:18:45,783 --> 00:18:47,246
Something's written here

330
00:18:50,061 --> 00:18:52,843
Look for a movable wooden box

331
00:18:52,844 --> 00:18:54,815
and move it within the frame
and shine the flashlight on top of the box

332
00:18:54,816 --> 00:18:55,966
[and you will find the key]

333
00:18:56,162 --> 00:18:58,781
We have to look for a movable wooden box

334
00:19:00,213 --> 00:19:02,653
(HANJIN) A movable box?

335
00:19:03,336 --> 00:19:07,485
[They start searching the boxes nearby]

336
00:19:08,266 --> 00:19:11,276
Something movable...
HANJIN, I think this one can move

337
00:19:11,277 --> 00:19:12,691
-That's not it
-Huh?

338
00:19:12,692 --> 00:19:15,180
-It said a wooden box
-But this is wood

339
00:19:15,181 --> 00:19:18,694
That's wood? Isn't it cardboard?

340
00:19:19,394 --> 00:19:21,314
-It's not
-Maybe this isn't it

341
00:19:24,145 --> 00:19:27,268
Isn't it this? A wooden box!

342
00:19:27,854 --> 00:19:30,245
-This one moves
-Yeah! Let's go

343
00:19:30,571 --> 00:19:34,134
[Found two movable wooden boxes]

344
00:19:35,760 --> 00:19:37,094
(KYUNGMIN) Let's go

345
00:19:37,631 --> 00:19:38,705
KYUNGMIN, be careful

346
00:19:38,706 --> 00:19:40,478
Let's put one in first

347
00:19:41,405 --> 00:19:42,333
Here's the flashlight

348
00:19:42,334 --> 00:19:44,139
You don't need to bring that

349
00:19:44,692 --> 00:19:47,393
[KYUNGMIN shines the light on top of the box]

350
00:19:48,580 --> 00:19:49,605
It says it's empty

351
00:19:49,606 --> 00:19:51,558
(HANJIN) Really? Then it's this one

352
00:19:54,242 --> 00:19:57,886
[They check the other box]

353
00:19:58,293 --> 00:20:00,083
- This one is also empty
- Empty?

354
00:20:02,231 --> 00:20:04,005
-KYUNGMIN!
-JIHOON! Come over here

355
00:20:04,006 --> 00:20:05,534
-JIHOON!
-(JIHOON) Yeah?

356
00:20:05,535 --> 00:20:08,218
-There's a box here
-(JIHOON) Yeah

357
00:20:08,219 --> 00:20:09,634
Bring all of those boxes

358
00:20:09,878 --> 00:20:10,870
-Why?
-Can you bring that one over?

359
00:20:10,871 --> 00:20:12,985
-Which box?
-This one says 'empty'

360
00:20:13,668 --> 00:20:16,190
[Another similar-looking box nearby]

361
00:20:16,191 --> 00:20:18,110
I think it's this one

362
00:20:21,656 --> 00:20:23,592
This one's a little heavy

363
00:20:25,431 --> 00:20:27,741
[The three of them carefully move the box]

364
00:20:28,099 --> 00:20:30,457
I'm going to check now

365
00:20:36,022 --> 00:20:38,527
[Checks the password]

366
00:20:41,830 --> 00:20:44,303
[DOHOON who was passing by also joins in]

367
00:20:44,612 --> 00:20:45,474
What's going on?

368
00:20:45,669 --> 00:20:46,580
We can get a key if we do this

369
00:20:46,581 --> 00:20:47,963
These guys were doing it

370
00:20:48,761 --> 00:20:50,631
The four of us shouldn't be together

371
00:20:51,428 --> 00:20:52,942
I shouldn't be here right now

372
00:20:52,943 --> 00:20:55,236
While the other members
are doing the mission

373
00:20:55,528 --> 00:20:57,822
I'll go and check out our location

374
00:20:58,896 --> 00:21:00,116
854!

375
00:21:03,955 --> 00:21:06,852
[The lock opens]

376
00:21:07,096 --> 00:21:08,267
Be careful

377
00:21:09,341 --> 00:21:10,480
What's this?

378
00:21:14,254 --> 00:21:16,223
[The box is filled with packing peanuts]

379
00:21:16,224 --> 00:21:17,670
We need to find the key in here

380
00:21:23,283 --> 00:21:24,259
I found it

381
00:21:31,646 --> 00:21:33,077
[KYUNGMIN screams]

382
00:21:33,468 --> 00:21:34,851
[DOHOON jumps and drops the key]

383
00:21:37,893 --> 00:21:40,105
You found it

384
00:21:48,695 --> 00:21:53,088
Now I'm the seeker

385
00:22:05,827 --> 00:22:07,730
They're insane

386
00:22:07,731 --> 00:22:10,968
I knew they'd do that

387
00:22:11,814 --> 00:22:15,637
[Hide-and-seek begins]

388
00:22:16,027 --> 00:22:17,752
Are you okay?

389
00:22:17,996 --> 00:22:19,948
[KYUNGMIN is lying down in shock]

390
00:22:20,550 --> 00:22:21,689
What's wrong?

391
00:22:29,970 --> 00:22:32,508
[The three guys run away from the seeker]

392
00:22:47,703 --> 00:22:52,974
Ready or not

393
00:22:52,975 --> 00:22:58,815
here I come

394
00:22:59,856 --> 00:23:02,215
[←DOHOON]
Oh no, what do I do?

395
00:23:04,672 --> 00:23:06,673
I'm not ready yet

396
00:23:07,535 --> 00:23:12,302
Ready or not

397
00:23:15,441 --> 00:23:19,509
here I come DOHOON

398
00:23:20,322 --> 00:23:22,242
Why am I so scared right now

399
00:23:22,243 --> 00:23:25,431
[DOHOON goes into the corner of the warehouse]

400
00:23:25,562 --> 00:23:29,091
[Hides inside the transparent plastic]

401
00:23:31,255 --> 00:23:33,412
[HANJIN and KYUNGMIN]

402
00:23:36,966 --> 00:23:38,007
HANJIN, there's a hole here

403
00:23:38,283 --> 00:23:39,519
It's okay

404
00:23:40,545 --> 00:23:41,651
Are you in?

405
00:23:42,774 --> 00:23:44,726
[← HANJIN and KYUNGMIN] [Hiding in the table]

406
00:23:46,759 --> 00:23:51,022
[SHINYU]

407
00:23:51,884 --> 00:23:53,544
(SHINYU) It's too tight

408
00:23:55,691 --> 00:23:57,367
[Phone alert]

409
00:23:57,920 --> 00:23:59,628
[Hide-and-seek starts now]
Play time is 4,444 seconds

410
00:23:59,629 --> 00:24:02,947
If you get caught by the seeker
you go to prison

411
00:24:03,484 --> 00:24:05,322
The survival rate is very important
in this game

412
00:24:05,323 --> 00:24:06,640
If the survival rate is over 50%

413
00:24:06,641 --> 00:24:08,434
then 42 (SAI) will receive presents

414
00:24:08,435 --> 00:24:10,756
so do your best and get a high survival rate

415
00:24:11,130 --> 00:24:14,368
We need to give 42 (SAI) presents

416
00:24:19,297 --> 00:24:22,681
[↑ JIHOON]

417
00:24:23,593 --> 00:24:28,310
[Hidden behind the stacked boxes]

418
00:24:29,140 --> 00:24:31,548
[DOHOON] [HANJIN and KYUNGMIN]

419
00:24:31,549 --> 00:24:32,866
[SHINYU] [JIHOON]

420
00:24:32,867 --> 00:24:35,518
[YOUNGJAE]

421
00:24:35,519 --> 00:24:38,462
Ready or not

422
00:24:39,503 --> 00:24:44,189
here I come

423
00:24:49,688 --> 00:24:51,168
[HANJIN and KYUNGMIN ↓]
(KYUNGMIN) I think we hid pretty well

424
00:24:51,169 --> 00:24:52,193
(HANJIN) Yeah

425
00:24:52,194 --> 00:24:54,276
KYUNGMIN, I was so scared earlier

426
00:24:54,277 --> 00:24:57,025
I thought you were hurt or something

427
00:24:57,026 --> 00:24:58,343
I just collapsed there

428
00:24:58,344 --> 00:24:59,644
Shhh

429
00:25:16,889 --> 00:25:19,655
[The seeker's footsteps]

430
00:25:20,079 --> 00:25:23,462
Please don't come! I'm going to faint

431
00:25:26,895 --> 00:25:30,718
[← DOHOON] [HANJIN and KYUNGMIN ↓]

432
00:25:32,540 --> 00:25:33,695
Oh no

433
00:25:33,972 --> 00:25:35,355
Please

434
00:25:35,648 --> 00:25:37,405
[← DOHOON] [HANJIN and KYUNGMIN ↓]

435
00:25:37,585 --> 00:25:40,301
[The seeker goes towards the members]

436
00:25:50,485 --> 00:25:52,242
[HANJIN and KYUNGMIN ↓][SEEKER↓] [DOHOON↓]

437
00:26:02,361 --> 00:26:05,941
[HANJIN and KYUNGMIN ↓][SEEKER↓] [←DOHOON]

438
00:26:06,608 --> 00:26:09,699
[The seeker's footsteps fade]

439
00:26:09,700 --> 00:26:11,944
[←DOHOON] [HANJIN and KYUNGMIN ↓]
(HANJIN) Wow, the seeker's gone

440
00:26:11,945 --> 00:26:13,603
(HANJIN) The seeker's gone

441
00:26:19,574 --> 00:26:23,625
[The seeker] [JIHOON]
[The seeker and JIHOON are far apart]

442
00:26:24,829 --> 00:26:27,155
(JIHOON) My hair color is way too bright

443
00:26:29,401 --> 00:26:32,313
I want to go the place I set up earlier

444
00:26:32,314 --> 00:26:34,330
but I don't know if I'll make it

445
00:26:34,331 --> 00:26:37,291
It's also close to the prison

446
00:26:39,406 --> 00:26:41,993
[Can hear someone appearing]

447
00:26:41,994 --> 00:26:43,571
[JIHOON→]

448
00:26:43,572 --> 00:26:45,360
[SHINYU→]

449
00:26:50,501 --> 00:26:52,828
Can you see how I'm sweating?

450
00:26:54,015 --> 00:26:55,382
(SHINYU) Guys, I'm going crazy over here

451
00:26:55,383 --> 00:26:57,616
(SHINYU) I can't do this anymore

452
00:27:02,117 --> 00:27:05,680
(Seeker)

453
00:27:05,681 --> 00:27:07,095
[← DOHOON] [HANJIN and KYUNGMIN ↓]
(KYUNGMIN) Wait, hold on

454
00:27:07,096 --> 00:27:08,755
(KYUNGMIN) I don't know if you can see
the light from outside

455
00:27:09,292 --> 00:27:09,959
Cover up the light

456
00:27:09,960 --> 00:27:10,935
Okay

457
00:27:13,603 --> 00:27:18,744
[←DOHOON] [HANJIN and KYUNGMIN↓]
[The seeker's footsteps]

458
00:27:24,097 --> 00:27:25,219
Shhh

459
00:27:26,423 --> 00:27:29,026
[The seeker's footsteps]

460
00:27:50,469 --> 00:27:53,283
[Found you, DOHOON!]

461
00:27:54,064 --> 00:27:56,797
[DOHOON's scream]

462
00:27:56,798 --> 00:27:58,034
Please stop! I'm sorry!

463
00:27:58,035 --> 00:28:00,328
I'm sorry!
Don't take me!

464
00:28:02,866 --> 00:28:06,022
[HANJIN and KYUNGMIN laugh]

465
00:28:06,559 --> 00:28:07,795
(DOHOON) Okay, fine! I'm going

466
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:13,262
DOHOON... I just heard him scream

467
00:28:14,400 --> 00:28:15,702
This is my opportunity

468
00:28:16,434 --> 00:28:17,459
I need to escape

469
00:28:17,801 --> 00:28:19,851
DOHOON just screamed

470
00:28:20,599 --> 00:28:22,144
He just got caught, this is crazy

471
00:28:23,771 --> 00:28:25,626
Let's go now

472
00:28:25,627 --> 00:28:27,676
I need to escape

473
00:28:28,652 --> 00:28:30,035
That's it

474
00:28:30,036 --> 00:28:33,956
[YOUNGJAE] [JIHOON]

475
00:28:33,957 --> 00:28:35,534
Where is it?

476
00:28:36,607 --> 00:28:38,771
I found it

477
00:28:39,666 --> 00:28:44,026
[JIHOON hides in the location he set up
before the game started]

478
00:28:44,303 --> 00:28:49,655
[YOUNGJAE] [JIHOON]
I did it!

479
00:28:49,656 --> 00:28:54,194
[JIHOON  →] [SHINYU goes past JIHOON]

480
00:28:57,708 --> 00:29:01,580
I had a hideout spot checked out earlier

481
00:29:02,020 --> 00:29:05,290
A spot where nobody can find me

482
00:29:06,054 --> 00:29:07,567
Let's hide

483
00:29:08,007 --> 00:29:09,357
I'll hide here

484
00:29:09,845 --> 00:29:11,797
This is the best hiding spot

485
00:29:12,708 --> 00:29:15,198
[Goes in the generator room in the machine room]

486
00:29:15,344 --> 00:29:19,818
[YOUNGJAE] [SHINYU]

487
00:29:20,404 --> 00:29:22,372
Wow, this is so scary

488
00:29:22,974 --> 00:29:25,284
I'm sorry 42, I didn't hide very well

489
00:29:25,285 --> 00:29:28,327
[SHINYU] [DOHOON] [YOUNGJAE] [HANJIN]
[JIHOON] [KYUNGMIN]

490
00:29:28,328 --> 00:29:31,288
[YOUNGJAE] [SHINYU] [←YOUNGJAE]

491
00:29:32,086 --> 00:29:34,607
(YOUNGJAE) I think this is a good hiding spot

492
00:29:34,608 --> 00:29:37,031
I wonder if the other members are okay
